* Hermetic ngspice init for sim/varactor-characterization.
*
* run_varactor_sweep.sh copies this file into the scratch directory it runs
* ngspice from, so a run does NOT depend on whether $HOME/.spiceinit exists
* (the PDK ships libs.tech/ngspice/install.py, which symlinks one into $HOME;
* a cold-start checkout on a machine where that was never run must still
* reproduce the committed numbers). Identical rationale and setting to
* ../tank-characterization/.spiceinit.
*
* ngbehavior=hsa is the compatibility mode the PDK's own .spiceinit sets, and
* is what its model libraries are written against.
set ngbehavior=hsa
